--- !u!1001 &483739360
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1024029554}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 5186214313345669470, guid: d7b2f16bb17bd7e45b1b5759b2bcfbc5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'This sample demos the new pinch interaction enabled by the force-sensing
        thumbrest. The thumbrest force is an analog input from [0, 1].


        Light
        presses on the <style=input>ThumbRest</style> flex the thumb. Pressing the
        <style=input>Index Trigger</style> flexs the index finger. Pressing the <style=input>Grip
        Trigger</style> flexs the lower hand.


        When used together, the <style=input>ThumbRest
        + Index Trigger</style> pinch. The <style=input>Grip Trigger</style> is used
        to grab objects.


        While holding an object, medium-to-heavy presses
        on the <style=input>ThumbRest</style> will squeeze to objects.


        Try
        grabbing, pinching, and squeezing objects.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5186214313345669470, guid: d7b2f16bb17bd7e45b1b5759b2bcfbc5, type: 3}
